    "html": "<p>The table below shows how the magnitude of the stretching force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> varies with the extension <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> for a linear elastic spring.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Extension <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x / \\text{m}\"></span></th><th>Force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F / \\text{N}\"></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0.00</td><td>0.0</td></tr><tr><td>0.20</td><td>5.0</td></tr><tr><td>0.40</td><td>10.0</td></tr><tr><td>0.60</td><td>15.0</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the total work done by the force to stretch the spring from an extension of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0 \\text{ m}\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.60 \\text{ m}\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">25 J</li><li data-label=\"B\">15 J</li><li data-label=\"C\">4.5 J</li><li data-label=\"D\">9.0 J</li></ol>"
